\begin{slogan}
A (local) trivialisation of a linebundle
is the same as a (local) nonvanishing section.
\end{slogan}

\begin{reference}
A reference for this fact is \cite[II, Err 1, Prop. 1.8.1]{EGA}
where it is attributed to J. Tate.
\end{reference}

